  "instructions": [
    "Heat the iron-teppan over medium heat and add the vegetable oil.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the diced bitter melon and cook until it is tender.",
    "Add the kabse spice and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the diced potato and grated carrot to the pressure cooker.",
    "Pressure cook the mixture for 5 minutes.",
    "Let the pressure release naturally, then open the lid and stir the mixture.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve the hash hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
